# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Maestro — .gitignore
# Goal: publish the reusable framework only. Keep all real business/project
# data LOCAL (it stays on disk and keeps working, it is just never committed).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# === Project data (LOCAL ONLY — never publish) ===
# Concrete projects live under projects/<name>/. Only the bundled
# `example-wxapp` sample is tracked; every real project stays private.
/projects/*
!/projects/example-wxapp/
!/projects/README.md

# Per-project memory accumulates locally as you use Maestro. Nothing under
# memory/projects/ is published except the placeholder + its README.
/memory/projects/*
!/memory/projects/.gitkeep
!/memory/projects/README.md

# Semantic search embedding cache — generated locally from your own memory
# documents. Local-only (can be large; vectors mirror private memory content).
/memory/.embedding_cache.json

# Runtime artifacts (task packages, run state, perf traces) are local outputs.
# Keep the directory placeholders, drop the contents.
/runtime/task-packages/*
!/runtime/task-packages/.gitkeep
/runtime/task-runs/*
!/runtime/task-runs/.gitkeep
/task-runs/
/runtime/perf-cases/*
!/runtime/perf-cases/.gitkeep
/runtime/routing-decisions.jsonl

# Artifact-lifecycle outputs: compressed archives, per-task scratch area,
# and the temp-file TTL registry are all machine-local.
/runtime/archive/
/runtime/scratch/
/runtime/temp-files.json
/runtime/temp-files.json.lock

# Personal design journal, assessments, eval logs and dated planning notes are
# kept LOCAL. The published docs/ carries only ARCHITECTURE.md and ROADMAP.md.
/docs/assessments/
/docs/system-specs/
/docs/system-plans/
/docs/system-evolution/
/docs/superpowers/
/docs/agent-learning/

# Patterns distilled from private business projects stay LOCAL; only
# business-free generic patterns are tracked explicitly.
/memory/patterns/h5-server-side-signing-proxy-heterogeneous-backend.md
/memory/patterns/miniprogram-webview-ticket-token-auth.md
/memory/patterns/uniapp-scrollview-height-and-tab-indicator-alignment.md

# Active-task pointer is runtime state (machine-local)
/runtime/active-task.json
/runtime/active-task.json.lock

# Scratch / temp work area
/.codex-temp/
/.worktrees/

# === Heavy / generated artifacts ===
# Bundled scraping MCP carries a large venv + downloads; excluded wholesale.
/tooling/scrapling-mcp/

# Vertical-specific diagnostics tool (built around a single private adapter);
# kept local until a generic, business-free engine is extracted.
/tooling/solo-diagnostics/

# Python environments and caches
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
build/
dist/

# Agent runtime config (may hold tokens/credentials — never publish)
/.claude/
/.codex/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
